RtkFilters.Net (rtk-dotnet)
===========================

This is an unofficial .NET 8 port of a subset of rtk
(https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk), pinned at commit
08a261a0d081ffe11a32986e2f4d76f3fdc33abb.

The port includes translations and verbatim copies of Apache-2.0 licensed
upstream sources:

  - src/core/toml_filter.rs   (filter pipeline)
  - text/src/lib.rs           (strip_ansi, truncate, estimate_tokens)
  - src/filters/*.toml        (copied verbatim to upstream/filters/)

